Subject: [PATCH 04/30] Add IV/EV editor to the summary skills page

START on the skills page opens it. Set IVs 0-31 freely; move EVs between
stats in steps of 4 through a pool, so the total can't increase.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
